sations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Wh-Questions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use Wh-questions to get information about places, people and things.<br><br> You ask Wh-questions often when you travel."}, {"type": "example", "content": "What should I do when I travel by bus?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What is the best way to travel?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Where do I buy my train ticket? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Who do I ask about my itinerary?"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Wh-Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ask questions about ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"things\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"people\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"where\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"places\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"time\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "When does the cruise ship arrive?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lightly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in small amounts "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Remember to pack lightly. Don't bring too many things."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about travel."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to occupy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to fill or take up "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Bring books to occupy your time on the bus."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stretch "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move your body to relax your muscles "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Remember to stretch before you get on the bus."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "continent "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "one of the seven large land masses in the world "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Europe is a continent."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "limited "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "restricted in size and amount "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is limited space on a bus."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bathroom "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a room that has a toilet and sink"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Using a bathroom on a bus is not fun."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to print "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to transfer text to paper "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Print your itinerary before you get on the bus."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to consider "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to think about something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should consider how far you are going."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob05aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "method "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a way of doing something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many methods of transport: bus, train, car, etc."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob05aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le03ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of two questions about travel. Ask your partner to do the same."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write them down, and give them to your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your partner gives you their questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write answers for each question in 2-3 sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Give your answers back to you partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your questions and answers out loud to each other. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about traveling in English."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask questions to get information about traveling."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give simple instructions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write responses to my partner's questions."}]}], "type": "sena"}